  "goodToKnow": "Die Quarantäne is quarantine: in Quarantäne müssen, sich in Quarantäne begeben, die Quarantäne aufheben. During the Covid pandemic, German health offices (Gesundheitsämter) ordered millions of quarantines. The word comes from Italian quaranta giorni (forty days), the isolation imposed on ships in Venice during plague times. Unusually, the Qu is pronounced k: ka-ran-TAI-ne. Plural: die Quarantänen."
